{"id":"3345a825b0656579","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-gentzen-consistency-alias.md","title":"Gentzen 一致性陈述的历史别名","display":"df-gentzen-consistency-alias — Gentzen 一致性陈述的历史别名","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-gentzen-consistency-alias","aliases":["18-df-gentzen-consistency-alias","18-df-048"],"display":"df-gentzen-consistency-alias — Gentzen 一致性陈述的历史别名","depends_on":["[[18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","verification_status":"local-alias-upstream-dependent"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-gentzen-consistency-alias"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-gentzen-consistency-alias</span><span>18-df-048</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gentzen-consistency-alias — Gentzen 一致性陈述的历史别名"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98c11a88e50650e8\" href=\"?note=98c11a88e50650e8\" title=\"18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface\">18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-alias-upstream-dependent"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P,A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathcal P,A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98c11a88e50650e8\" href=\"?note=98c11a88e50650e8\" title=\"18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface\">18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface</a> 的全部输入条件及其语义对应假设：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{PRA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\varepsilon_0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(I_{\\varepsilon_0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 为该上游的三参数谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GentzenTheorem}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{GentzenTheorem}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 是下式定义的同签名历史别名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GentzenTheorem}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GentzenTheorem}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仅保留旧命名接口；别名等价不是 Gentzen 定理的证明。数学内容及其来源资格完全由上游 003 决定，本节点不独立提升核验状态。三个参数分别提供相容对象语言中的 PRA 公理、递归记号上的对象归纳公理以及一致性对象句；语义 TI 不被直接当作对象句加入理论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface","status":"resolved","id":"98c11a88e50650e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface","status":"resolved","id":"98c11a88e50650e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P,A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 满足 [[18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface]] 的全部输入条件及其语义对应假设：$A_{\\mathrm{PRA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$I_{\\varepsilon_0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S$。$\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}$ 为该上游的三参数谓词；$\\mathrm{GentzenTheorem}_{\\mathcal P}$ 是下式定义的同签名历史别名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P,A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathrm{PRA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\varepsilon_0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GentzenTheorem}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GentzenTheorem}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}}).","display":true}],"bytes":1586,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-gentzen-consistency-alias]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-gentzen-consistency-alias]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-gentzen-consistency-alias|18-df-gentzen-consistency-alias]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-gentzen-consistency-alias|18-df-gentzen-consistency-alias]]"}],"outgoing":["98c11a88e50650e8"]}